config PAYLOAD_MM_INTERFACE
	bool
	default n
	help
	  Implements coreboot-to-payload compatibility layers for sharing SMM. coreboot will
	  continue to initialise and own SMM. Payload can register to be called on SMI too.
	  An example use-case is enabling EDK2 Secure Boot with Authenticated Variables.

	  Select N if unsure.

config PAYLOAD_MM_SMRAM_SIZE
	hex
	depends on PAYLOAD_MM_INTERFACE
	default 0x155000
	help
	  The amount of SMRAM to reserve for payload MM. This amount is sufficient for Secure Boot,
	  with some left over as spare. It requires platforms to support 2M of SMRAM.
